<section id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-left">
      <p class="section-label">About</p>
      <h2>Program manager.<br/>Community architect.<br/>Builder.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-right">
      <p>
        I'm a Program Manager where I support developer programs that collectively
        reach over 200,000 developers every year.
      </p>
      <p>
        My background is in Systems Engineering (University of Lagos) and I hold an MBA 
        from Quantic School of Business and Technology. I spend most of my time at the 
        intersection of people, programs, and products.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond my day job, I co-founded API Conference Lagos, run Finance Roundtable,
        program manage events for Web3 Afrika, and launched <a href="https://morningscroll.xyz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-link">Morning Scroll</a>.
      </p>

      <ul class="about-list">
        <li>
          <span class="list-icon">◈</span>
          BSc Systems Engineering, University of Lagos
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="list-icon">◈</span>
          MBA, Quantic School of Business & Technology (96.07%)
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="list-icon">◈</span>
          Based in Lagos, Nigeria
        </li>
      </ul>

      <a href="mailto:sodiq.akinjobi@gmail.com" class="about-cta">
        Get in touch <span>→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.about-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: start;
}

.about-left h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  line-height: 1.25;
}

.about-right {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.2rem;
}

.about-right p {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.about-list {
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.about-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

.list-icon {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  margin-top: 0.3rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.inline-link {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
}

.about-cta {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  transition: gap 0.2s;
}

.about-cta:hover { gap: 0.75rem; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
}
</style>
